{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a first-person walking simulator where players relive paranormal encounters connected to the haunted location known as &quot;Lantern House&quot; and uncover the truth behind the events that took place there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561460/extras/001.png?t=1743563158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The place called &quot;DOORS&quot; offers the collection and reliving of paranormal experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There, you are led to a single door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561460/extras/002.png?t=1743563158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was the room of a person who had been investigating the haunted location known as &quot;Lantern House.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561460/extras/003.png?t=1743563158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player relives several collected eerie tales, they analyze and uncover what truly happened there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb<strong>Genre</strong>: Walking Simulator / Atmospheric Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb<strong>Ending</strong>: 1 ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fb<strong>Gameplay Duration</strong>: 30 to 60 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561460?t=1743563158","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561460?t=1743563158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561460/f4a5ac1f00b4c1e635d07912816a3871ec2167a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743563158","capsule_imagev5"